<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bidvest cautions it in talks.</title>
<headline>Bidvest cautions it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bidvest Group Ltd and Bid Corp Ltd said on Tuesday that Bidvest was in discussions which, if successful, could affect the price of its instruments listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings. A further announcement would be made as soon as possible, the firm said.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>	  -- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
